.TH "RK\-YAZI\-FILTER Reference" "" "" ""
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]f\f[R]: Filter files in the current directory (e.g., \f[CR]f\f[R]
then \f[CR].png\f[R] to only show PNGs)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]s\f[R]: Search for files with \f[CR]fd\f[R] (includes
subdirectories)
.SH Active Filter
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]<Enter>\f[R]: Keep the filter while navigating
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]<Esc>\f[R]: Clear the filter (also works after it\(cqs been kept
with \f[CR]<Enter>\f[R])
.SH Patterns
.IP \(bu 2
Filters are regexes (e.g., \f[CR]\(rs.png$\f[R] only matches names
ending in \f[CR].png\f[R], while \f[CR].png\f[R] matches \f[CR].png\f[R]
anywhere in the name)
.IP \(bu 2
Filters are smart case: lowercase matches both cases (e.g.,
\f[CR]png\f[R] matches \f[CR].PNG\f[R]), and any uppercase makes the
filter case sensitive
